 "_about": "Nothing's control commands, read from Nothing X 3.4.15 (com.nothing.smartcenter, decompiled outside the repo on 2026-10-18; none of its code is here): com.nothing.base.protocol.constant.ProtocolConstant, by the names it gives, and the EQ commands com.nothing.core.ext.TWSDeviceExtKt keeps to itself. code is the 16-bit command in hex: reads are C0xx, writes F0xx, events the earbuds send unasked E0xx, debug FCxx. The earbuds answer a command with it and bit 15 cleared. never_send marks firmware update, factory reset, calibration, test and debug traffic; private marks reads whose replies hold a serial number or other devices' addresses, which PairFree never sends. docs/nothing/PROTOCOL.md explains the frame and the payloads.",
